# Copy to .env and fill in if you want LLM-rendered explanations.
#
# THE DEMO RUNS WITHOUT THIS. With no key, context.py uses its deterministic
# template renderer and the system behaves identically — the LLM only ever
# rephrases a decision that has already been made.
#
# .env is gitignored. Verify before putting a real key here:
#     git check-ignore -v .env
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# Optional. Defaults to gpt-5.5. Override if your account has different access.
# OPENAI_MODEL=
